<!DOCTYPE score-partwise PUBLIC "-//Recordare//DTD MusicXML 4.0 Partwise//EN" "http://www.musicxml.org/dtds/partwise.dtd">
<!--
  Phase 55/§19.10 fixture: one vocal lead sheet carrying every kind of text
  this engine draws.

  - two lyric verses, with <syllabic> hyphenation ("Hal-le-lu-") and a
    melisma <extend/> on "lu"
  - an elision (two <lyric number="1"> on one note) on the last measure
  - four <harmony> chord symbols: a major seventh, a minor seventh, a
    dominant seventh with a slash bass, and a sharp-rooted diminished
  - a <rehearsal> mark and a <words> direction

  Deliberately hand-written rather than exported from MuseScore, so that
  each construct appears exactly once and a failure names one thing.
-->
